      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Bheur hag of the Storm-Cast Future; daughter of Endelyn Moongrave of Yon and one of the Three who rule Coven Cove. Tall, hook-backed, wrapped in a ragged aurora of violet and gray, carrying the Masthead Staff whose bells ring only when someone in the room is about to lie. The most openly frightening of the Three and the most fragile; she is assembling a killing-winter ritual in the ice cliffs east of town and has not decided whether to use it. While the coven circle is dead she has no Shared Spellcasting, no Hag Eye, and the omens have gone quiet.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
      "source": {
        "custom": "Coven Cove GM Guide",
        "revision": 1,
        "rules": "2014"
      }
